===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|cheyne}}, {{m|enm|chaine}}, from {{der|en|fro|chaine}}, {{m|fro|chaene||chain}}, from {{der|en|la|catēna||chain}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*kat-||to braid, twist; hut, shed}}. <!--Cognate with {{cog|frr|ketten||chain}}, {{cog|nl|keten||chain}}, {{cog|nds|Kede||chain}}, {{cog|de|Kette||chain}}, {{cog|da|kæde||chain}}, {{cog|sv|kedja||chain}}, {{cog|is|keðja||chain}}.--> {{doublet|en|catena}}.

